OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FNewcastle United have announced the
OL,7,Fappointment of Matthias Jaissle as
OL,8,Ftheir new head coach following Eddie
OL,9,FHowe's departure.
OL,11,FThe 38-year-old Al-Ahli boss, who met
OL,12,Fup with the players at their pre-
OL,13,Fseason training camp in La Manga over
OL,14,Fthe weekend, has started work after
OL,15,Fthe relevant paperwork was finally
OL,16,Fcompleted.
OL,18,FNewcastle are understood to have paid
OL,19,Fsignificant compensation ` reportedly
OL,20,Fin excess of #9 million ` to secure
OL,21,Fthe German's services.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
