FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FThe former RB Salzburg boss said: "It
OL,7,Fis an incredible honour to become head
OL,8,Fcoach of Newcastle United. This is one
OL,9,Fof the biggest clubs in European
OL,10,Ffootball, with a unique history,
OL,11,Fidentity and supporter base, and I am
OL,12,Fexcited to experience that passion and
OL,13,Fconnection first-hand.
OL,26,@nD@cOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,F"When Newcastle United comes your way,
OL,7,Fyou take notice. The ambition of the
OL,8,Fclub, the vision for the future and
OL,9,Fthe opportunity ahead made this an
OL,10,Fincredibly compelling place to be. I
OL,11,Fhave followed the club's journey
OL,12,Fclosely in recent years and the
OL,13,Fprogress that has been made is clear
OL,14,Ffor everyone to see."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@UO]
