OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FJaissle arrives at St James' Park with
OL,7,Fa promising pedigree having guided
OL,8,FSalzburg to back-to-back Austrian
OL,9,Ftitles before heading for the Saudi
OL,10,FPro League in 2023 and winning
OL,11,Fsuccessive Asian Champions League
OL,12,Fcrowns with Al-Ahli.
OL,14,FSaudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund,
OL,15,FNewcastle's majority owner, bought a
OL,16,Fcontrolling share in four Pro League
OL,17,Fclubs, including Al-Ahli, in 2023.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
