PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FNewcastle chief executive David
OL,7,FHopkinson said: "Matthias is one of
OL,8,Fthe most exciting and highly regarded
OL,9,Fyoung coaches in football and I'm
OL,10,Fthrilled to welcome him to Newcastle
OL,11,FUnited.
OL,13,F"We have conducted a thorough process,
OL,14,Fand he has emerged as the clear
OL,15,Fcandidate for the role. He possesses
OL,16,Fall the qualities we were looking for."
OL,18,FJaissle has big shoes to fill on
OL,19,FTyneside following Howe's decision to
OL,20,Fstep down from his role on Friday
OL,21,Fafter almost five years in charge.
OL,26,@oD@QOUuD@AOUxD@gO]
