PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FThe former Bournemouth boss was handed
OL,7,Fthe reins in November 2021 just weeks
OL,8,Fafter Amanda Staveley's consortium had
OL,9,Fcompleted its takeover, and aided by a
OL,10,Fsignificant cash injection he dragged
OL,11,Fthe Magpies back from the brink of
OL,12,Frelegation from the Premier League.
OL,14,FIn the process, he restored the
OL,15,Fconnection between the fans and the
OL,16,Fclub and created an optimism which was
OL,17,Frewarded by a return to Champions
OL,18,FLeague football and a first major
OL,19,Fdomestic trophy in 70 years when they
OL,20,Flifted the Carabao Cup in March 2025.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
