OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FHowever, Howe departed after a
OL,7,Fdifficult 2025-26 campaign, which was
OL,8,Fderailed before a ball had been kicked
OL,9,Fby Alexander Isak's defection to
OL,10,FLiverpool.
OL,12,FThis summer's departures of Kieran
OL,13,FTrippier, Anthony Gordon and Sandro
OL,14,FTonali ` and the reported likely exit
OL,15,Fof skipper Bruno Guimaraes to Arsenal
OL,16,F` have left the squad in a state of
OL,17,Fflux.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
