PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1786384096
OL,3,CNewcastle United confirm appointment
OL,4,Cof Matthias Jaissle as new head coach
OL,6,FJaissle faces the task of steadying
OL,7,Fthe ship off the pitch before
OL,8,FNewcastle open the new campaign at
OL,9,Fhome to Liverpool on August 23.
OL,11,FHe added: "I am incredibly excited
OL,12,Fabout the future. I fully and
OL,13,Funreservedly believe in this project,
OL,14,Fthe ambition and the direction the
OL,15,Fclub is taking.
OL,17,F"There is a clear vision, strong
OL,18,Fleadership and an exceptional platform
OL,19,Fto build on."
